{%- render 'glp1-assets' -%}
<div class="g1">
  <section class="g1-sec">
    <div class="g1-wrap">
      <div class="g1-split" style="align-items:center">
        <figure class="g1-fig">
          <div class="g1-vt">The BMJ study, July 2026</div>
          <h4>GLP-1 users lost hair more often than people on 2 other diabetes drugs.</h4>
          <div class="g1-legend"><span><i class="g1-sw-a"></i>GLP-1</span><span><i class="g1-sw-g"></i>Other diabetes drug</span></div>
          <div class="g1-grp">
            <div class="g1-gh">vs SGLT-2 drugs: +37%</div>
            <div class="g1-hrow" title="GLP-1: 6.91 cases per 1,000 person-years"><div class="g1-lab">GLP-1</div><div class="g1-track"><div class="g1-bar g1-sw-a" style="width:98.7%"></div></div><div class="g1-num">6.91</div></div>
            <div class="g1-hrow" title="SGLT-2: 5.04 cases per 1,000 person-years"><div class="g1-lab">SGLT-2</div><div class="g1-track"><div class="g1-bar g1-sw-g" style="width:72%"></div></div><div class="g1-num">5.04</div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="g1-grp">
            <div class="g1-gh">vs DPP-4 drugs: +68%</div>
            <div class="g1-hrow" title="GLP-1: 6.53 cases per 1,000 person-years"><div class="g1-lab">GLP-1</div><div class="g1-track"><div class="g1-bar g1-sw-a" style="width:93.3%"></div></div><div class="g1-num">6.53</div></div>
            <div class="g1-hrow" title="DPP-4: 3.89 cases per 1,000 person-years"><div class="g1-lab">DPP-4</div><div class="g1-track"><div class="g1-bar g1-sw-g" style="width:55.6%"></div></div><div class="g1-num">3.89</div></div>
          </div>
          <p class="g1-cap">Hair loss cases per 1,000 person-years. Source: Tang et al., The BMJ, July 22 2026. Adults with type 2 diabetes, 2019 to 2024.</p>
        </figure>
        <div class="g1-story">
          <div class="g1-eyebrow">This is now on record</div>
          <h2 class="g1-h2">The shot. The shed. The numbers.</h2>
          <p>In July 2026, the BMJ compared more than 27,000 adults with type 2 diabetes. The GLP-1 group lost hair more often than both groups on other diabetes drugs.</p>
          <p>In 1 survey, 20% of GLP-1 users said they had shedding. That's 1 in 5. And nearly 9 in 10 of the people who report it are women.</p>
          <p>Most hair advice was never built for this.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "GLP-1 On record",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [{ "name": "GLP-1 On record" }]
}
{% endschema %}
